# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This is the file that makes a fresh clone on Windows agree. `core.autocrlf` is false in this
# clone, but a global `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise check these files out as CRLF and the
# next commit would show every line changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch a file that is not text. `text=auto` sniffs content, and a generated file can sniff
# wrong, so the shapes this project has produced are named explicitly.
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.o binary
*.rlib binary
*.bin binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
